  "name": "Create faceless YouTube Shorts with Sora 2 and auto-post to TikTok and Instagram Reels",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ba582ddc-82e7-41aa-a346-f28d6e1f325c",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -700,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 900,
        "content": "## Faceless YouTube Shorts on autopilot with Sora 2\nEvery morning an AI picks a new idea in your niche, Sora 2 renders a vertical video with sound, and PostWire posts it as a YouTube Short, a TikTok and an Instagram Reel, each with its own caption. Every video is logged, so the AI never repeats a topic.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every day at 9:00** starts the run; **Channel settings** holds your niche, style and length.\n2. **Read past videos** and **List past topics** load what you already posted.\n3. **Write today's Short** (OpenAI) returns a new topic, a Sora 2 prompt and a caption idea.\n4. **Generate the video with Sora 2** renders a 9:16 clip with audio.\n5. **Post to Shorts, TikTok and Reels** uploads it once; PostWire writes a native caption, YouTube title and tags per network.\n6. **Published?** logs each network's link in Google Sheets, or logs the error and emails you the fix.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified **PostWire** node (search \"PostWire\" in the nodes panel), create an account at postwire.io, connect your networks (one click each: no developer app, no Meta or TikTok review) and paste your API key into a **PostWire API** credential.\n2. Add an **OpenAI** credential to the chat model and to the Sora 2 node (Sora 2 is billed by OpenAI per second of video).\n3. Create a Google Sheet with the columns `date, topic, network, status, link, note`, select it in the three Google Sheets nodes and add a Gmail credential.\n4. Edit **Channel settings**: niche, style, seconds (4, 8 or 12) and your email.\n\nFree PostWire plan: 20 posts a month and 2 networks per post, no card; 3 or more networks per post need a paid plan."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
